## [S15] 거부 이벤트 — AuthorizationEventPublisher Bean 유무

(1) default context: AuthorizationEventPublisher beans = []
(1b) servlet web context(server.port=0): AuthorizationEventPublisher beans = [], SecurityFilterChain beans = [defaultSecurityFilterChain]

(2) events context: AuthorizationEventPublisher beans = [authorizationEventPublisher]
    @PreAuthorize deny (DenialProbe.denied, hasRole('NOPE')) -> thrown=AuthorizationDeniedException events=1 [AuthorizationDeniedEvent(isGranted=false)]
    @PostAuthorize deny (OrderProbe.withdraw bob) -> thrown=AuthorizationDeniedException events=1 [AuthorizationDeniedEvent(isGranted=false)]
    @PostFilter removes 1 of 2 (EventFilterProbe.withDrop) -> thrown=- events=0 []
    @PreAuthorize pass (SecureProbe.secured as ADMIN) -> thrown=- events=0 []

(3) after setShouldPublishResult { true }:
    @PreAuthorize pass -> events=1 [AuthorizationDeniedEvent(isGranted=true)]
# exit=0
